# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine generated output. All of this is rebuilt from source and must
# never be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DDC/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / toolchain scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Content is deliberately NOT tracked here.
#
# It is 8.5 GB, almost entirely two licensed marketplace packs
# (MWLandscapeAutoMaterial and SD_Art Industrial_Architecture). GitHub caps
# individual files at 100 MB and free Git LFS at 1 GB, so this cannot be pushed
# as-is -- and redistributing purchased marketplace assets is a licensing
# question in its own right.
#
# Leading slash matters: it anchors this to the project's own Content/ only.
# Without it the pattern matches Content/ at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# Plugins/TerraDyne-main/Content/ -- the plugin's tracked assets survived only
# because ignore rules do not apply to already-tracked files, so the breakage
# showed up as newly added plugin content being quietly dropped.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Content/*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nested plugin repositories.
#
#   Plugins/Monolith  third-party MCP editor tooling with its own upstream at
#                     https://github.com/tumourlove/monolith.git. Not ours to
#                     carry, and ~3 GB. Clone it separately.
#
# Plugins/TerraDyne-main is NOT ignored: it is where this project's real
# development happens, so it is imported into this repository via a subtree
# merge with its history intact.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Plugins/Monolith/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UnrealDrive_CitySample: MetaRoad's CitySample-styled content pack, otherwise
# covered by the /Content/* rule above. Carves out only the road-material and
# roadside-prop assets RealtimeRoadSplineActor/RealtimeRoadJunctionActor
# actually reference -- traced as a real dependency closure (recursively
# grepping each .uasset for embedded /Game/... asset-path strings, not
# hand-picked), 78 files / ~719 MB of the pack's full ~3.8 GB.
#
# Git will not look inside an excluded directory for negation patterns at
# all (a bare 'dir/' ignore rule is atomic), so every level has to be
# negated-then-re-wildcard-ignored in a cascade -- !dir/ to allow descent,
# dir/* to re-ignore its contents as individual (negatable) entries again --
# down to each leaf directory, where the specific files below are negated
# individually instead of the whole directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/
/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/*
!/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/MasterMaterials/
/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/MasterMaterials/*
!/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/Materials/
/Content/UnrealDrive_CitySample/Materials/*
